#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle8/scripts.inc:30
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle8_Text_WroteSecretCodeLockOpened"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} wrote down the secret code\n"
"on the door.\p"
"“TRICK MASTER I love.”\n"
"… … … … … … … …\p"
"The lock clicked open!$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}在门上写下了暗号。\p"
"“我爱机关大王。”\n"
"…… …… …… …… …… …… …… ……\p"
"咔嚓一声，锁打开了！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle8/scripts.inc:37
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle8_Text_VincentIntro"
msgid ""
"Not many TRAINERS have made it\n"
"this far.$"
msgstr "能走到这里的训练家可不多。$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle8/scripts.inc:41
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle8_Text_VincentDefeat"
msgid "That must mean you're tough, too…$"
msgstr "这说明你也很强啊……$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle8/scripts.inc:44
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle8_Text_VincentPostBattle"
msgid ""
"You've beaten the POKéMON LEAGUE\n"
"CHAMPION? That's too much!$"
msgstr ""
"你打败过宝可梦联盟的冠军？\n"
"这也太厉害了吧！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle8/scripts.inc:48
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle8_Text_KeiraIntro"
msgid ""
"Consider yourself lucky to be\n"
"battling me!$"
msgstr "能和我对战，你就偷着乐吧！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle8/scripts.inc:52
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle8_Text_KeiraDefeat"
msgid ""
"This isn't right!\n"
"I can't lose!$"
msgstr "这不对！我不可能输的！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle8/scripts.inc:56
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle8_Text_KeiraPostBattle"
msgid ""
"It's a miracle that you beat me.\n"
"You can brag about it.$"
msgstr ""
"你能打败我真是个奇迹。\n"
"你可以拿去炫耀了。$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle8/scripts.inc:60
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle8_Text_LeroyIntro"
msgid ""
"You've been slugging through the TRICK\n"
"HOUSE challenge, too.$"
msgstr "你也一直在努力挑战机关屋啊。$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle8/scripts.inc:64
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle8_Text_LeroyDefeat"
msgid ""
"I see…\n"
"You possess an extraordinary style.$"
msgstr "原来如此……你有着非凡的风格。$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle8/scripts.inc:68
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle8_Text_LeroyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"Seeing someone like you should please\n"
"the TRICK MASTER.$"
msgstr ""
"看到你这样的人，\n"
"机关大王一定会很高兴的。$"
